{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play as the owner of a matchmaking agency in Paris, 1888, and decide: romantic unions or marriages of convenience? Each decision shapes your clients\u2019 fates\u2026 and the survival of your agency.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paris, 1888</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/c156e580b07ccc8fc331d4655986b30b.poster.avif?t=1760082477\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/c156e580b07ccc8fc331d4655986b30b.webm?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/c156e580b07ccc8fc331d4655986b30b.mp4?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play Marie, an independent young woman with a complicated past who has just gone into debt to take over a matchmaking agency in the heart of Paris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a period Paris in magnificent Art Nouveau\u2013style settings. Discover Les Halles, the Champs-\u00c9lys\u00e9es, and other emblematic locations such as the Eiffel Tower\u2026 still under construction!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet characters inspired by real inhabitants of the era. Take the time to speak with them: your success\u2014or your failure\u2014depends on your ability to untangle truth from falsehood.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/6897d78f10fe05208537e664b452490b.poster.avif?t=1760082477\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/6897d78f10fe05208537e664b452490b.webm?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/6897d78f10fe05208537e664b452490b.mp4?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no money and no contacts, you start from nothing. You will have to find potential people to propose to your clients yourself!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true investigative task awaits: question your clients, find and observe prospective suitors, uncover their tastes, desires, and sometimes unspeakable secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every piece of information helps you decide which union to propose. But beware: a poorly arranged marriage can ruin lives\u2026 and tarnish your agency\u2019s name.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who will you choose?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/622fc68f96aad61cdfc8009482d4712b.poster.avif?t=1760082477\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/622fc68f96aad61cdfc8009482d4712b.webm?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/extras/622fc68f96aad61cdfc8009482d4712b.mp4?t=1760082477\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For each client, you have several options, including proposing a marriage of convenience or a romantic union.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the balance is fragile: defending love marriages risks bankruptcy; yielding to marriages of convenience sacrifices your clients\u2019 happiness. Your reputation, your connections, and the future of your agency depend on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept your role as an architect of destinies. The choices you make will determine whether Marie becomes the keeper of passions, guided by the heart\u2026 or a pragmatic negotiator, mistress of profits. Each marriage is as much a moral wager as a step toward your agency\u2019s survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 19th-century matchmaker:</strong> an independent heroine at the heart of the period\u2019s personal, social, and political dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Art Nouveau game:</strong> an art direction inspired by artists such as Alphonse Mucha and Eug\u00e8ne Grasset, two famous poster artists of the 19th century.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices shape the narrative:</strong> each decision affects the story and your agency\u2019s reputation. Several different endings await you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conduct the investigation:</strong> uncover the true nature of your clients and their suitors through a system inspired by the <i>Ace Attorney</i> series and the <i>Golden Idol</i> games.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045600?t=1760082477","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/c6091aced4caa0026c8bcfd3be0b8a6f7825f3f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760082477","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/d1a316e60fd19463ebfd466055e2607ad13c37c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760082477","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/d1a316e60fd19463ebfd466055e2607ad13c37c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760082477","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","