_paragraph\" >For each client, you have several options, including proposing a marriage of convenience or a romantic union.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the balance is fragile: defending love marriages risks bankruptcy; yielding to marriages of convenience sacrifices your clients\u2019 happiness. Your reputation, your connections, and the future of your agency depend on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept your role as an architect of destinies. The choices you make will determine whether Marie becomes the keeper of passions, guided by the heart\u2026 or a pragmatic negotiator, mistress of profits. Each marriage is as much a moral wager as a step toward your agency\u2019s survival.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 19th-century matchmaker:</strong> an independent heroine at the heart of the period\u2019s personal, social, and political dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Art Nouveau game:</strong> an art direction inspired by artists such as Alphonse Mucha and Eug\u00e8ne Grasset, two famous poster artists of the 19th century.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices shape the narrative:</strong> each decision affects the story and your agency\u2019s reputation. Several different endings await you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conduct the investigation:</strong> uncover the true nature of your clients and their suitors through a system inspired by the <i>Ace Attorney</i> series and the <i>Golden Idol</i> games.</p></li></ul>","developers":["1888 Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045600/840259ce004e1f985f76c03000a86f12ab252580/header.jpg?t=1760082477","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"ht